    "muscleNotes": {
      "hamstrings": "The hamstrings brake the forward fall as the knees straighten (eccentric knee flexion) and pull the body back up; a classic hamstring-strength exercise with high hamstring activity in hamstring exercise comparisons (McAllister 2014 compared related movements).",
